    <briefdescription>
<para>GPU backend dispatch bounded runtime contract. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Guarantees:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>All allocation operations complete with bounded latency (see timeout constants).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Backend selection happens under a single lock acquisition (selectDevice()).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Diagnostic events are emitted atomically for each error condition.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Concurrent dispatch attempts are rejected fail-closed rather than silently serialized. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
